  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "At \\(x=2\\), each occurrence of \\(x^x\\) becomes \\(2^2=4\\). Therefore the base and exponent of the outer power are both four:\n\\[(x^x)^{(x^x)}=4^4=4\\cdot4\\cdot4\\cdot4=256.\\]\nThe answer is choice C.",
